{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bat &amp; Ball</strong> is a fast, focused baseball-inspired challenge where every swing counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around pure reflexes and precision, the gameplay is simple to learn and brutally satisfying to master. You control everything with just your mouse \u2014 time your swings, keep the streak alive, and don\u2019t let anything drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No tutorials. No fluff. Just you, the bat, and the rising pressure of perfection.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/132f0f782d7647e345a65ac94977e3d2.poster.avif?t=1755913747\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/132f0f782d7647e345a65ac94977e3d2.webm?t=1755913747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/132f0f782d7647e345a65ac94977e3d2.mp4?t=1755913747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83c\udfae Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Tight, minimalist gameplay</strong> based on timing and rhythm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Unlockable cosmetic skins</strong> through achievements and random drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Steam Inventory support</strong> (tradable &amp; marketable skins)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f <strong>Steam Achievements</strong> to test your skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcca <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong> \u2014 climb the ranks and prove your streak is the best</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/d63f1b46baa9a32a21437dc2ae86a872.poster.avif?t=1755913747\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/d63f1b46baa9a32a21437dc2ae86a872.webm?t=1755913747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/d63f1b46baa9a32a21437dc2ae86a872.mp4?t=1755913747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Microtransactions. No Shortcuts.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No loot boxes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No premium currencies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No pay-to-win</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bat and ball skin is unlocked by <strong>playing the game</strong> \u2014 not by opening your wallet. <br>Once earned, skins become <strong>Steam Inventory items</strong> you can <strong>collect, trade, or sell</strong> on the Steam Marketplace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/b5db6ce7487f6ca07f30cb72b73669df.poster.avif?t=1755913747\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/b5db6ce7487f6ca07f30cb72b73669df.webm?t=1755913747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/b5db6ce7487f6ca07f30cb72b73669df.mp4?t=1755913747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hit 40!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3715720/de7c771d850de50c5782cbb4630b9b4c05a33ede.jpg"},{"name":"Hit 60!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat