":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Leaderboard Event Countdown \u2013 Win the Gold Bat &amp; Ball!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Leaderboard Event</strong> has begun! A countdown timer is now live in the main menu.<br>On <strong>September 22nd</strong>, when the timer hits zero, the <strong>player at the very top of the leaderboard</strong> will unlock the <strong>Gold Bat &amp; Gold Ball skins</strong>. \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>How it works:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play and climb the leaderboard before the deadline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on the countdown timer in the menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When time runs out, the #1 player wins the prize.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Tip: Consistency matters \u2014 every match can push you closer to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Reminder:</strong> All skins in the game, including these, are <strong>tradable and marketable</strong> on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, and may the best player shine in gold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/f336e7affb2f467c3e493788e8d2b3c4.poster.avif?t=1755913747\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/f336e7affb2f467c3e493788e8d2b3c4.webm?t=1755913747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/f336e7affb2f467c3e493788e8d2b3c4.mp4?t=1755913747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bat &amp; Ball</strong> is a fast, focused baseball-inspired challenge where every swing counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around pure reflexes and precision, the gameplay is simple to learn and brutally satisfying to master. You control everything with just your mouse \u2014 time your swings, keep the streak alive, and don\u2019t let anything drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No tutorials. No fluff. Just you, the bat, and the rising pressure of perfection.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/132f0f782d7647e345a65ac94977e3d2.poster.avif?t=1755913747\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/132f0f782d7647e345a65ac94977e3d2.webm?t=1755913747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/132f0f782d7647e345a65ac94977e3d2.mp4?t=1755913747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83c\udfae Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Tight, minimalist gameplay</strong> based on timing and rhythm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Unlockable cosmetic skins</strong> through achievements and random drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Steam Inventory support</strong> (tradable &amp; marketable skins)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f <strong>Steam Achievements</strong> to test your skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcca <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong> \u2014 climb the ranks and prove your streak is the best</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps